{"id":"643883","name":"凉拌凤尾芹","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/643883/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西芹","amount":"2根"}],"sub":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"一个"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"些许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"西芹洗净。","img":"images/643883/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去掉起楞的部分。","img":"images/643883/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"斜切，不要切断，连切3～5刀再切断。","img":"images/643883/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后再竖着切细丝，也不要切断。","img":"images/643883/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"冷水浸泡，用冰水浸泡最好。","img":"images/643883/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"至少浸泡2小时。","img":"images/643883/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"番茄做造型。","img":"images/643883/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"摆上芹菜。","img":"images/643883/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"大蒜和红椒切末。","img":"images/643883/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放碗里加食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/643883/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅烧热油。","img":"images/643883/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"油冒烟浇在菜末上。","img":"images/643883/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放蒸鱼豉油或者生抽，拌匀。","img":"images/643883/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"料汁浇在芹菜上，不要均匀，最好就是一坨一坨的。","img":"images/643883/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/643883/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/643883/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}